ine! Thank you for considering my request :))", "created_at": "", "completed_at": ""}, {"path": "/@Cacao_obeya/works/34", "thumbnail_src": "https://si.imgix.net/4b321730/uploads/origins/76d47915-b544-4a77-a466-e6e703125a44?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=9c65f8f187cab52df106af18d426c317", "thumbnail_srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/4b321730/uploads/origins/76d47915-b544-4a77-a466-e6e703125a44?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=9c65f8f187cab52df106af18d426c317, https://si.imgix.net/4b321730/uploads/origins/76d47915-b544-4a77-a466-e6e703125a44?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=e26c660a2e048c848cabe526a8d07d3c 2x, https://si.imgix.net/4b321730/uploads/origins/76d47915-b544-4a77-a466-e6e703125a44?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=ae3a5b28c5d86aead583737e55d9dedd 3x", "genre": "art", "nsfw": false, "body": "チビのページが欲しい\n\nhttps://drive.google.com/drive/folders/14vtAHXa4Bdy90Nl3hGtQgxbNNbrxQom7", "created_at": "", "completed_at": ""}, {"path": "/@Cacao_obeya/works/33", "thumbnail_src": "https://si.imgix.net/e9fd67cd/uploads/origins/5148d54c-fb69-4550-b9f6-5bd7e8509c49?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=75db050d2f969cfbd6196346e244cb9e", "thumbnail_srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/e9fd67cd/uploads/origins/5148d54c-fb69-4550-b9f6-5bd7e8509c49?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=75db050d2f969cfbd6196346e244cb9e, https://si.imgix.net/e9fd67cd/uploads/origins/5148d54c-fb69-4550-b9f6-5bd7e8509c49?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=65da3cc2ae7e8e4b8a053f8a319f7c5d 2x, https://si.imgix.net/e9fd67cd/uploads/origins/5148d54c-fb69-4550-b9f6-5bd7e8509c49?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=6025b221f746a63b034c43850e08f7cc 3x", "genre": "art", "nsfw": false, "body": "Hello there,\nThank you for the appeal! I would be happy for you to draw Seo. If possible, please include her fairy companion, Alisa, otherwise just Seo is perfectly fine.\nSeo is a gyaru high elf who is very friendly and outgoing, like a typical gyaru but she's very fond of cooking and cleaning. Alisa is a NEET mangaka who loves to lounge around and procastinate.\nFeel free to draw them how ever you wish.\nI look forward to your work.\n\nSeo & Alisa: https://photos.app.goo.gl/5nG89M2fYF6M4wmc9", "created_at": "", "completed_at": ""}, {"path": "/@Cacao_obeya/works/32", "thumbnail_src": "https://si.imgix.net/694090d2/uploads/origins/9bf1c270-9a47-412f-87bc-283d54ac5986?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=c037d836302e5747d74073c2dc7f30a8", "thumbnail_srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/694090d2/uploads/origins/9bf1c270-9a47-412f-87bc-283d54ac5986?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=c037d836302e5747d74073c2dc7f30a8, https://si.imgix.net/694090d2/uploads/origins/9bf1c270-9a47-412f-87bc-283d54ac5986?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=9ecc873b1a647af72998396177283f68 2x, https://si.imgix.net/694090d2/uploads/origins/9bf1c270-9a47-412f-87bc-283d54ac5986?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=bc19ffbde9513f1323bd893821867e60 3x", "genre": "art", "nsfw": false, "body": "こんにちは！\n\nアピールありがとうございます！私のOCを描いていただけるなんて、とても嬉しいです！\n\nどんな風に描いても構いません。服装や髪型も自由です。\n\nhttps://drive.google.com/drive/folders/1H7fei7bcZfHq1zhRqoOyLGrB7fWaVVsH", "created_at": "", "completed_at": ""}, {"path": "/@Cacao_obeya/works/31", "thumbnail_src": "https://si.imgix.net/98c0c09c/uploads/origins/6bf9754a-38bf-46da-b9a4-2e61fec58539?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=e524e49335761450709f4b8d14feea22", "thumbnail_srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/98c0c09c/uploads/origins/6bf9754a-38bf-46da-b9a4-2e61fec58539?bg=%23fff&auto=